      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "Then the Spirit looked at Barbelo, with the pure light that surrounds it.",
          "es": "Entonces el Espíritu miró a Barbelo, con la luz pura que lo rodea."
        },
        {
          "en": "And she conceived from it.",
          "es": "Y ella concibió de él."
        },
        {
          "en": "She gave birth to a spark of light, a light like the blessed light.",
          "es": "Dio a luz una chispa de luz, una luz parecida a la luz bendita."
        },
        {
          "en": "But the spark was not as great as the Spirit.",
          "es": "Pero la chispa no era tan grande como el Espíritu."
        },
        {
          "en": "He was the only child of the Mother-Father, the only one born of the pure light.",
          "es": "Era el único hijo de la Madre-Padre, el único nacido de la luz pura."
        }
